634f3.mp4?t=1755250644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Eras, New Rules, Same Pain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces a new mechanic designed either to  ruin your day. One moment you're dealing with inverted scroll controls, the next you're stuck in a time period where gravity changes direction at random, each era brings its own flavour of torment. Just when you think you\u2019ve mastered the controls, the game finds a new way to mess with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596410/extras/146e6d871a6ecceb2d01f24ec4e66746.poster.avif?t=1755250644\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596410/extras/146e6d871a6ecceb2d01f24ec4e66746.webm?t=1755250644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596410/extras/146e6d871a6ecceb2d01f24ec4e66746.mp4?t=1755250644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
